<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-01T16:53:09.761Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:53:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to assault Plateau, killing a soldier at a military checkpoint and stealing weapons, and later wounded a soldier with a machete and injured two civilians with gunshots in a community attack. In Zamfara, security forces repelled a bandit attack, discovering more than 30 bodies of suspected bandits and reporting a gun battle that left over 30 bandits dead. An ISWAP shura council member and top commanders were killed as troops repelled an attack in Borno. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNdXVib1JfRjZjSzVhZHdDQU9WNGItdk5kd2s3REFyN21jZ0NaNDBBcWE1NFJtQ3hzTXAwQ21KRk5xc1k5R3VYdmZ1U2pGMnJQRmE5a0N5Njl4YUpEazM5c0lMTUo3UHlKLVB4UDNvSDd0WHR5RFltMEs3R2MtUVdKVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNQktpX2U5d2hvMENWRE16WDdsR0xqUGlSTkVsOWpoc2l4d3NoS3VpdjF1Uk45c2dRSlJ0NXJESV9MaGZNUm82U0ZTbjJXRDlnb0JScldHeGpkOVlOLUp3N3FxWVlhTFdkRlpoc0dTREZzR1E0ZHdwdEVfdnlMekVCS1lRSExsN29rLVRnZmRnWERfTm5DMU5CQnR5ZHBheFZ0bF9YUFFqUTFtWDRK?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQMDlEVUttbFNlSmxZcTE0QlZQT0lNdDM3MjlicVo3OVVURXlfcGdYSEFpWV9JU1NYSkE0V1lRUDF1WTllMDlqNk9zd2tuSGpyWmlVQ2hHTkxFTzVvOGNqOXI5enU1SXN0Z2NGeFhLTFJ2OFhVU2dOLU13Nm1xOW0wb2QwajZPT3dkMmlXRlhRaGVYSGt0UFhFWjJxa2JJZ3RkNUtIcUZLU0VhQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nigerian Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPc0dhQ2s4eVFaT3A4QlZueEIxWjVhZDRrX0JiVlRTQWdFTGJWM2NnYnRvYnpIYXhJRTFBZWdzbTdvS21yVDFoV19YclBMdTJST0Z3RE9JV0F3U2NWZG5qODBySC1objNCeWtpc2RqNW9KaF8yOXlpeU5pdmVUcl9fNEx1MTYyT1BCRXA5NE84QW4wTDVobTNuNE5pNnpjVDg1bkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt